What will be the output of the following code?

x = 5
if x > 3:
    print("Greater")
else:
    print("Smaller")

What is the output of the following code?

x = 10
y = 20
if x > y:
    print("x is greater")
elif x == y:
    print("x and y are equal")
else:
    print("y is greater")

